# Documented comparison, 5 November 2026

This compares public documentation, not controlled agent runs. Stars are repository-wide snapshots, not quality scores. We do not claim to outperform these projects.

| Project | Stars at about 22:05 IST | Documented offering |
|---|---:|---|
| UI UX Pro Max |145,577|Industry reasoning, style/palette/type search and multiple stacks|
| Taste Skill |110,474|Researched directions, real imagery, browser checks and critique|
| Anthropic skills |187,658|Multi-skill repository; frontend-design gives subject-specific visual guidance. Stars are NOT frontend-design-only|
| scroll-craft |4,568|Scroll-led page grammars, fingerprinting, engine and verification scripts|

Sources:
https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill
https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
https://github.com/anthropics/skills/blob/main/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md
https://github.com/nateherkai/scroll-craft

Industry routing, variation and screenshot review are established ideas, not claimed inventions here. Website Craft's first release combines a source-aware industry asset schema, explicit reference invitation, truthful demo content and paired same-brief authored examples. Those are deliverables to inspect, not proof of universal superiority. The catalog is small; external discovery links are not bundled assets. No competitors' code or skill text was copied into this package.
